OL,3,ACanada becoming EU 'associate member'
OL,4,Awould be positive move, Carney says,
OL,5,Aafter Trump criticism
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe Canadian leader was responding to
OL,8,Fcriticism from US President Trump, who
OL,9,Fthreatened tariffs on Europe and called
OL,10,Fthe idea of Canada becoming the bloc's
OL,11,Ffirst associate member "laughable" -
OL,12,Fwhat is an EU 'associate member'?
OL,14,FThe US recently increased tariffs on
OL,15,FCanadian goods, with Canada responding
OL,16,Fwith tariffs of its own
